        "content": "## AR-24 FindAppointment\n\nLookup keys of the endpoint sheet (2026-10-23): customerId, chassisNumber, offerId, status. The session's customer and vehicle are the keys; a spoken reference code only narrows. Exactly one booked appointment becomes the appointment in hand (DealerBook booking id, offer id, dealer); several are listed for the caller to choose from.",
